<del></del></span> Reputation for Shadow Priests in Phase 1</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. As a Shadow Priest, we recommend you prioritize <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1269/golden-lotus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Golden Lotus</span></a> to get your hands on  <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89072/simple-harmonius-ring">
